    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d70">

                <pb facs="0168" n="72" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg72"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Señor Morla Vicuña.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-03-17"><hi rendition="#italic">March 17,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 12.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 13th instant in regard to the exchange of ratifications of
                    the claims convention signed at Washington on May 24, 1897, between the United
                    States and Chile, and to confirm in writing the verbal understanding agreed upon
                    by you and Dr. Hill. The exchange should be postponed until October 15 next.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
